      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ludington is the home port of the SS Badger, a vehicle and passenger ferry that sails daily across Lake Michigan to Manitowoc during summer.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
